@startuml Jacobi_Theory

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam participantPadding 100
skinparam wrapWidth 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 500

participant "Master/\nOrchestrator" as Master
participant "SU₁" as SU1
participant "SU₂" as SU2
participant "SU₃" as SU3

== Jacobi Co-Simulation: One Macro Step tₙ → tₙ₊₁ ==

Master -> Master: **Phase 1: Set All Inputs**
note right: All inputs frozen at tₙ\nusing outputs from previous step

Master -> SU1: set u₁(tₙ) from y(tₙ₋₁)
activate SU1
SU1 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU1

Master -> SU2: set u₂(tₙ) from y(tₙ₋₁)
activate SU2
SU2 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU2

Master -> SU3: set u₃(tₙ) from y(tₙ₋₁)
activate SU3
SU3 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU3

Master -> Master: **Phase 2: Parallel Integration**
note right: All SUs integrate\nindependently from tₙ to tₙ₊₁

par Parallel Execution
    Master -> SU1: doStep(tₙ, H)
    activate SU1
    SU1 -> SU1: x₁ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₁(tₙ, x₁ⁿ, u₁ⁿ)
    SU1 -> SU1: y₁ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₁(tₙ₊₁, x₁ⁿ⁺¹)
    SU1 --> Master: outputs y₁(tₙ₊₁)
    deactivate SU1
else
    Master -> SU2: doStep(tₙ, H)
    activate SU2
    SU2 -> SU2: x₂ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₂(tₙ, x₂ⁿ, u₂ⁿ)
    SU2 -> SU2: y₂ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₂(tₙ₊₁, x₂ⁿ⁺¹)
    SU2 --> Master: outputs y₂(tₙ₊₁)
    deactivate SU2
else
    Master -> SU3: doStep(tₙ, H)
    activate SU3
    SU3 -> SU3: x₃ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₃(tₙ, x₃ⁿ, u₃ⁿ)
    SU3 -> SU3: y₃ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₃(tₙ₊₁, x₃ⁿ⁺¹)
    SU3 --> Master: outputs y₃(tₙ₊₁)
    deactivate SU3
end

Master -> Master: Exchange outputs at tₙ₊₁
note right: New outputs available\nfor next macro step

@enduml